{"posts":[{"id":"josh_p13_301","t":"","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#301","p":13,"im":["3893da50cb54e37806879ec21802f7a18932c5d9"],"m":301},{"id":"josh_p13_302","t":"audusd","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#302","p":13,"im":["a5d93e743d5ceaa8b3780ef0ad587237f28275a0"],"m":302},{"id":"josh_p13_303","t":"Thoughts on euraud..","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#303","p":13,"im":["47fb792817e69fbf90acd1b1a60563e2f6449a34"],"m":303},{"id":"josh_p13_304","t":"","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#304","p":13,"im":["daae4a395927e6db45efdaf899013087e9ea8182"],"m":304},{"id":"josh_p13_305","t":"Time to sit back and wait.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#305","p":13,"im":["8e2f445faefc58b8a6315c2428ad3ad3b96da307"],"m":305},{"id":"josh_p13_306","t":"So I decided to take profit. I feel like price may want to test the opposite side of our upper CPAZ before making the break south.\n\njosh1125 wrote: Time to sit back and wait.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#306","p":13,"im":["638b307b5c658d09d479ab7ecfc9022e808d4d32","8e2f445faefc58b8a6315c2428ad3ad3b96da307"],"m":306},{"id":"josh_p13_307","t":"Eurcad offered a sell late in the day...Normally I wouldn't take a trade before the weekend, but PO got hit 0 DD entry... I feel like my trading has finally made that turn. After fully understanding the concept \"look left then left again\" things are so clear now.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#307","p":13,"im":["b179cf7a60b0903f0fed7217661e815f7a9351e4"],"m":307},{"id":"josh_p13_308","t":"","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#308","p":13,"im":["c33ec7ebfcea04d8f8562caa8a71362d3f05cca1"],"m":308},{"id":"josh_p13_309","t":"We could compress for days on this one. Just gonna have to be patient.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#309","p":13,"im":["cc657c640b043cfc739514a086e8ba4b43b54a29"],"m":309},{"id":"josh_p13_310","t":"entered gbpusd on QM...","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#310","p":13,"im":["345073e8c10ed54cde56723ea374ab2b6ef65a57"],"m":310},{"id":"josh_p13_311","t":"Thought it was ready to fall...jumped the gun on this one..\n\njosh1125 wrote: entered gbpusd on QM...","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#311","p":13,"im":["0702c12145d2be93c54a172f99857e29507a2689","345073e8c10ed54cde56723ea374ab2b6ef65a57"],"m":311},{"id":"josh_p13_312","t":"","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#312","p":13,"im":["d7851ce08c86ffe11fdcfe2a25c1518310a09945"],"m":312},{"id":"josh_p13_313","t":"nice start to the week. Quick trade on audcad","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#313","p":13,"im":["dadd58c0fa687e7bceb237a3203b005beb587067"],"m":313},{"id":"josh_p13_314","t":"The wait is definitely draining me...but I've got to be patient and wait for price to hit target.\n\njosh1125 wrote:","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#314","p":13,"im":["2e00e64efbc255511f4eed5193530dcb9a0f8d7b","d7851ce08c86ffe11fdcfe2a25c1518310a09945"],"m":314},{"id":"josh_p13_315","t":"","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#315","p":13,"im":["e8042773a4b85bf096d7975641a298784d12d82f"],"m":315},{"id":"josh_p13_316","t":"Hey guys haven't been around in a while...Here is a trade from today.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#316","p":13,"im":["652490a5cf526f2f1204b8bd06e17c3e8e02198c"],"m":316},{"id":"josh_p13_317","t":"josh1125 wrote: Hey guys haven't been around in a while...Here is a trade from today.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#317","p":13,"im":["03b3c7e3320c4abe2712c4bbecaf9c0be2d21418","652490a5cf526f2f1204b8bd06e17c3e8e02198c"],"m":317},{"id":"josh_p13_318","t":"Price finally returned to the QM level, with the HH of the QM reaching the opposite side of our CPAZ.\n\nLTF PA allowed me to enter this trade with extremely low risk. I entered at the return of a very nice swap level.\n\nI'm targeting this swap area which is also the origin of the most recent up move.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#318","p":13,"im":["995210a2ea982c498dbddc7f68f053dd09fede43","c3b2bf1c4a7eeaecc7dca22ec2ab4413105ea92d","2d27c92f8622d8dc8fb9a934d47d42175ce15deb"],"m":318},{"id":"josh_p13_319","t":"Congrats. I had same trade.","a":"karlo","d":"","n":"#319","p":13,"im":[],"m":319},{"id":"josh_p13_320","t":"Very nice entry Josh, I don't see where the QM is though?\n\nAlso could you explain why you entered where you did and not at either the SR flip or the supply I've drawn here? Thanks!","a":"ZeeDeveel","d":"","n":"#320","p":13,"im":["1e21d4240b6544aa029e61f3f2372a53e8217938"],"m":320},{"id":"josh_p13_321","t":"Guys, I think unfortunately this hit the tight stop as it went for the top QM/trick","a":"scoobydoo","d":"","n":"#321","p":13,"im":["be0112223540ca6b5e66d2ddd6e6c1caca42ed9c","8d9cd0f4df2152fd6c8a618c609bb2f64e1fe6f3"],"m":321},{"id":"josh_p13_322","t":"Thanks everyone for stopping by..As scooby pointed out I got stopped out of this trade. My HTF read was spot on, but my LTF read was pretty far off. Price actually formed a QM on the LTF...I've been struggling a bit lately with my ltf reads. With this trade I thought the swap zone would've been enough to hold price down, but price had other intentions. I spent a good portion of today reading benhur' s journal, as he is definitely amazing at spotting and entering low risk high reward trades using the qm.\n\nHere is the outcome of the trade, and i have also marked the completed QM on the LTF which is where my entry should have been.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#322","p":13,"im":["7e16c5cd85848467f56bfea2aaf4470cb6c435d1"],"m":322},{"id":"josh_p13_323","t":"Entering on a LTF like this in proximity to a HTF level seems dangerous, this is a mistake I've been making.. comes down to fear of missing the trade I think. Next time this situation arises, you'll wait to enter at the MPL and price will run off without you lol. That said, it's a 10R trade so it doesn't matter if you get stopped out 5 times.:) Keep on it man, I'm gonna re-read Benhur's journal now, these tight SL entries are eluding me slightly... I think a lot of it comes down to patience though, waiting for the MPL and being prepared to let other trades go.","a":"ZeeDeveel","d":"","n":"#323","p":13,"im":[],"m":323},{"id":"josh_p13_324","t":"ZeeDeveel, You are so right! The most difficult part for me is telling myself that if price don't hit my entry at the MPL, there are still plenty of opportunities. Learning to control that fear of missing a trade is very important. I've read so many of the masters state how waiting for the MPL really helps not to enter a trade too early, or based on emotions.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#324","p":13,"im":[],"m":324},{"id":"josh_p13_325","t":"We go from decision to decision","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#325","p":13,"im":["9a8a0aee2b015d38641999e0611a8019f9791167"],"m":325}],"images":[{"k":"be0112223540ca6b5e66d2ddd6e6c1caca42ed9c","t":"assets/thumbs/be0112223540ca6b5e66d2ddd6e6c1caca42ed9c.webp","f":"assets/images/be0112223540ca6b5e66d2ddd6e6c1caca42ed9c.jpeg","w":93,"h":144,"b":4087,"o":"be0112223540ca6b5e66d2ddd6e6c1caca42ed9c.jpeg","p":13,"pid":"josh_p13_321"},{"k":"3893da50cb54e37806879ec21802f7a18932c5d9","t":"assets/thumbs/3893da50cb54e37806879ec21802f7a18932c5d9.webp","f":"assets/images/3893da50cb54e37806879ec21802f7a18932c5d9.jpeg","w":923,"h":487,"b":57074,"o":"3893da50cb54e37806879ec21802f7a18932c5d9.jpeg","p":13,"pid":"josh_p13_301"},{"k":"a5d93e743d5ceaa8b3780ef0ad587237f28275a0","t":"assets/thumbs/a5d93e743d5ceaa8b3780ef0ad587237f28275a0.webp","f":"assets/images/a5d93e743d5ceaa8b3780ef0ad587237f28275a0.jpeg","w":1327,"h":445,"b":118392,"o":"a5d93e743d5ceaa8b3780ef0ad587237f28275a0.jpeg","p":13,"pid":"josh_p13_302"},{"k":"47fb792817e69fbf90acd1b1a60563e2f6449a34","t":"assets/thumbs/47fb792817e69fbf90acd1b1a60563e2f6449a34.webp","f":"assets/images/47fb792817e69fbf90acd1b1a60563e2f6449a34.jpeg","w":1361,"h":590,"b":120606,"o":"47fb792817e69fbf90acd1b1a60563e2f6449a34.jpeg","p":13,"pid":"josh_p13_303"},{"k":"daae4a395927e6db45efdaf899013087e9ea8182","t":"assets/thumbs/daae4a395927e6db45efdaf899013087e9ea8182.webp","f":"assets/images/daae4a395927e6db45efdaf899013087e9ea8182.jpeg","w":1357,"h":462,"b":85493,"o":"daae4a395927e6db45efdaf899013087e9ea8182.jpeg","p":13,"pid":"josh_p13_304